    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Two groups</p>
      <h2>Nursery and Kindergarten</h2>
      <p><strong>Nursery</strong> has two teachers in the room all day. The morning is learning time in short bursts: a story, a song, a tricky puzzle, a friend to play with. Then snack and play, lunch and a nap, and a gentler afternoon.</p>
      <p><strong>Kindergarten</strong> starts every day outside. Then phonics and maths, literacy, and after lunch a subject called Understanding the World, which is science and geography for four-year-olds.</p>
      <p>Both groups pick up English from the room. Most of our youngest children arrive with none.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--small" href="{{ '/families/schedule/' | url }}">See the Nursery and Kindergarten week</a>
    </div>
