{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Four things we watch for</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><h3>Social and emotional skills</h3><p>Sharing, waiting, saying what you need, calming down. Cooperative play with a teacher nearby to help it go well.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Physical development</h3><p>Climbing, balancing, pouring, cutting, drawing. Big movements and small ones, every day, on the turf and in the sand.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Language and literacy</h3><p>Stories, songs and a lot of conversation in English. Phonics starts when a child is curious about letters, not before.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Mathematics and reasoning</h3><p>Counting real things, sorting, noticing shapes and patterns. Maths as something you do with your hands first.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

